Updates
=======

Update system inputs and Flatpak apps separately.

System and application updates are separate. Preserve system.stateVersion; it is a
compatibility baseline, not an instruction to upgrade packages. From your writable
checkout, update inputs with nix flake update, then check and build before applying.
Keep a backup or recorded copy of the previous lock. Use the existing configured input
branch unless intentionally migrating.

Update Flatpaks through GNOME Software or sudo flatpak update --system. System
rollback does not restore Flatpak apps or app data.
